{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521620001:0":{"text":"あなたがヴェルナーさんですか？","source_cn":"你是维尔纳？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE4E2CFFF6EF7D5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521620002:0":{"text":"君たちは誰？俺に何か用？","source_cn":"你们是谁？找我有什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B94202889134ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521620003:0":{"text":"あなたのお父さまの手紙を見つけたんです。あと彫刻刀も。","source_cn":"我们找到了你阿爹的信。唔，还有刻刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BEC850A5F611864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521620004:0":{"text":"彫刻刀！？\nあり得ないね。父さんが他人に彫刻刀を渡すなど、絶対にない！","source_cn":"刻刀？！\\n怎么可能，我老爹不可能把他的刻刀交给任何人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2079C57AF25EFF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521620004":{"text":"彫刻刀！？\nあり得ないね。父さんが他人に彫刻刀を渡すなど、絶対にない！","source_cn":"刻刀？！\\n怎么可能，我老爹不可能把他的刻刀交给任何人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2079C57AF25EFF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521620005:0":{"text":"トータス町が壊滅……う、ウソだ！","source_cn":"图塔镇毁灭了……这、这不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A36F580F2F5E92E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521620006:0":{"text":"それに父さんと母さんが……巻き込まれた……","source_cn":"还有我老爹和老娘……他们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4AE0C8B5942610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521620007:0":{"text":"手紙を読めば、ご理解いただけると思います。","source_cn":"你看了信以后，就会明白的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA061CE06608686F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521620008:0":{"text":"ヴェルナーは震える手で手紙を受け取った。しばらくの沈黙が続いた後、彼の目から涙が溢れてきた。","source_cn":"维尔纳颤抖地接过信。好半晌的沉默之后，他的眼里已盛满泪水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF549B48EA2E7114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521620009:0":{"text":"と……父さんはどこに？俺、会いに行かないと……","source_cn":"我老爹……他，他在哪？我必须去找他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x770AA99817A5ED1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521620010:0":{"text":"彼はモンスターに変身して、もうあなたの知っているお父さまではありませんよ。","source_cn":"他已经畸变成怪物，不是你认识的那个人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4895B6397DB20F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521620011:0":{"text":"どんな姿になっていようと、父さんは父さんだ！頼む、連れていってくれ！","source_cn":"不管他变成什么样，他都是我老爹！求求你们，带我去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x598CE5871F24D33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521620012:0":{"text":"もう何年も帰ってないんだ……いつも手紙をくれてたのに、俺は忙しさを理由に……","source_cn":"我已经好几年没有回去了……他总是写信，但我总是忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0634147F09B20C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521620013:0":{"text":"せ……せめて最後くらい親孝行させてくれ……！","source_cn":"我……我不能连他最后一面也不见……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDC0367D16F292CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521620014:0":{"text":"でも、トータス町を訪れるのはあまりに危険です。","source_cn":"但是，图塔镇的黑暗对你来说太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CDA4F194F8BF58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1521620014":{"text":"でも、トータス町を訪れるのはあまりに危険です。","source_cn":"但是，图塔镇的黑暗对你来说太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CDA4F194F8BF58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_re